        "Stage 3 transcribes audio via Whisper if text cues fail to resolve"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Multimodal Verification Pipeline",
      "items": [
        "Selects the sharpest candidate video frame for Gemini 2.5 Flash analysis",
        "Gemini verifies whether visual landmarks match Google Places entity data",
        "Assigns VERIFIED, PARTIAL, or FAILED status truthfully"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Enrichment & Cleanup",
      "items": [
        "Google Places nearby search clusters POIs into 4 distinct categories",
        "Travel Intelligence synthesizes seasonality, budget tiers, and local tips",
